                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Imperial law of June 1, 1870, relating to the
                        acquisition and loss of allegiance in Germany.</hi></head>
                <list>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sec</hi>. 13. State allegiance shall in future
                        he lost only hy a sojourn ahroad of ten years’ duration.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sec</hi>. 14. The discharge is granted hy the
                        issue of a discharge document by the superior administrative authority of
                        the state of nativity.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sec</hi>. 15. The discharge will not be
                        granted until a certificate is ohtained from the circuit recruiting
                        commission (Kreis-Ersatz-Commission) showing that the same is not sought for
                        the sole purpose of evading service in the standing army or navy.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
